OL,3,GNEWSACancer survivor racks up 250th
OL,4,Aparkrun
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was given six months to live
OL,7,Fafter being diagnosed with terminal
OL,8,Fcancer has completed his 250th parkrun,
OL,9,F10 years on from his initial diagnosis.
OL,11,FRobin Ford, from Ruddington,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, was diagnosed with
OL,13,Fkidney cancer in 2016, aged 45, and was
OL,14,Ftold he would most likely not make it
OL,15,Fto Christmas.
OL,17,FHe quickly married his partner, Litza,
OL,18,Fand underwent two rounds of
OL,19,Fchemotherapy which shrank the tumour to
OL,20,Fthe point where it could be safely
OL,21,Fremoved, along with parts of his liver
OL,22,Fand pancreas.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
